      "question": "What is not included in a standard home inspection?",
      "answer": "Standard home inspection standards of practice exclude many specialized items. Routine contracts do not include radon testing, sewer line camera scopes, mold air sampling, wood-destroying insect evaluations, swimming pool equipment checks, private wells, or septic tanks. You must contract separate specialist evaluations for these components."
